# Vendored upstream sources, cloned on demand by each row's build.sh.
# These are third-party trees pinned to a SHA -- never commit them.
**/mruby/
**/mruby-io/
**/rlua/
**/pulse-binding-rust/

# Build output.
**/target/
**/build/

# Phase-2 host binaries, built on demand by shim/build-mruby-host.sh.
**/xlang-host

# Rake/mruby build stamps (build_config.rb.lock etc.) -- generated, not inputs.
**/*.lock
# ...but Cargo.lock IS an input: it pins transitive crate versions, which §2
# ("hermetic", "pin every version") wants captured rather than resolved afresh.
!**/Cargo.lock
